  "value": {
   "primary": "+1/+1-counter aristocrats: put counters on creatures (dethrone, Thran Vigil, Metallic Mimic, Forge of Heroes), sacrifice them for mana, cards and damage, let Marchesa return countered creatures at end step, and use counters to reset persist creatures into sacrifice loops.",
   "secondary": "Drain payoffs (Blood Artist, Mayhem Devil, Gray Merchant, Syr Konrad, Grave Pact) and Sneak Attack/Imperial Recruiter to find loop pieces."
  },
